  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/quillphen\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/贊助我-Patreon-ff424d?logo=patreon&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8GydmUN3xq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/加入Discord社群-5865F2?logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/贊助我-Ko--fi-571db5?logo=kofi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Support me on Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<h2 data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"82\"><strong>生物視覺</strong></h2>\n<p>輕鬆發現周圍的生物，甚至能穿透牆壁。<br data-start=\"132\" data-end=\"135\">此資源包會高亮顯示25格範圍內的所有附近生物。</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"246\" data-end=\"259\">功能特色：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"262\" data-end=\"318\">對所有附近的非玩家生物施加發光效果</li>\n<li data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"372\">無論手持物品或空手皆可運作</li>\n<li data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"409\">即時自動更新</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"468\">相容性：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"508\">Minecraft Java版 1.17及以上版本</li>\n<li data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"553\">單人與多人模式皆可使用</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1233/295/image_2025-06-27_225345377-png.png\" width=\"693\" height=\"430\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1233/294/image_2025-06-27_225336227-png.png\" width=\"691\" height=\"400\"></p>",
